  "_comment": "Negative. A producer declaring its own closure claim ENABLED. rkaf:closureClaimStatus is closed over exactly one value, rkaf:closureClaimDisabled, in every compiled target \u2014 so enabling closure is a CUE edit that moves the contract digest and forces every pinned consumer to re-accept, not a string a producer chooses (spec/rkaf-analysis.md 6)."
